{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30309","headline":"昔昔盐二十首 暗牑悬蛛网 · 赵嘏","name":"昔昔盐二十首 暗牑悬蛛网","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暗中蛛网织，历乱绮窗前。\n万里终无信，一条徒自悬。\n分从珠露滴，愁见隟风牵。\n妾意何聊赖，看看剧断弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}